Analisis S-box 8-bit (SBOX, src/core/sbox_table.inc)

Metrik                             S-box ini      Pembanding
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bijektif                           ya             wajib ya
Fixed point S[x] = x               0              ideal 0 (AES: 0)
Opposite fixed point S[x] = ~x     0              ideal 0 (AES: 0)
Nonlinearity (min komponen)        98             AES 112, acak tipikal 92-100
Max |Walsh|                        60             AES 32 (makin kecil makin baik)
Differential uniformity            10             AES 4, acak tipikal 10-12
Jumlah entri DDT bernilai maks     11             makin sedikit makin baik
Derajat aljabar komponen (min-max) 6-7            AES 7-7, maks 7
SAC rata2 (min-max)                0.499 (0.391-0.594) ideal 0.500

Probabilitas diferensial maks = 10/256 = 0.0391, bias linear maks = 60/512 = 0.1172
